# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in. Vite reads it automatically.

# The Hugging Face Connected App this configurator signs in with.
#
#   https://huggingface.co/settings/connected-applications
#   scopes:        openid profile read-repos write-repos
#   redirect URLs: http://localhost:5273   (this dev server, exact port)
#                  https://space.apartejs.dev
#
# One app covers both: a Connected App accepts several redirect URLs, and the one used
# is whichever origin the browser is on.
#
# Not a secret — an OAuth client id travels in the authorisation URL, in plain sight of
# the person signing in. A TOKEN or a client secret must never be put in this file, and
# never in the image: `VITE_*` values are inlined into the bundle every visitor loads.
#
# Left empty, the product still works: the sign-in panel drops the OAuth button and
# offers the paste-a-token path instead.
VITE_HF_CLIENT_ID=
